WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.067
-We here at "Late Night,"

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.634
we don't always have time
to cover the news,

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.767
so to help us out, here is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.634
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:13.200
-Thank you, Seth.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Things have been crazy!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.601
Okay, first of all,

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.567
pumpkin spice everything
is back,

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:20.133
and I'm like, "What?"

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.467
It is only September 7th.

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.767
But then I realized,
if pumpkin spice is back,

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.133
that means
it's almost Halloween,

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:27.734
which means
it's damn near Thanksgiving,

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.567
which means
it's Christmas tomorrow!

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:32.934
Yay!
I was like, "Whaat?"

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:36.067
Then I read a news story
that a man stole a plane

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.467
and threatened
to crash it into a Walmart.

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:39.601
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:41.701
Why would you take
a perfectly good Walmart

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.667
and turn it into a TJ Maxx?

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:47.300
Then I heard
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.267
compared President Biden to
Hitler, and I was like, "What?

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:54.834
Do you like Biden or not?
'Cause you seem to like Hitler.

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:56.934
And I'm pretty sure
he'd love you."

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:58.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.701
Then the FBI raided Mar-A-Lago

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.367
and found a bunch
of classified stuff,

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.767
and I was like, "What?!"

00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:08.133
Is Trump in real trouble?

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.167
Does that mean...

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.100
♪♪

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.767
Could it possibly mean...

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.400
♪ Maybe he'll go to jail -- ♪

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.968
-No, Amber, I just --

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:17.701
I just wouldn't get
your hopes up, you know?

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:18.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:20.234
-Yeah, you right.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:23.601
So, then the frigging
dumbest thing happened.

00:01:23.601 --> 00:01:25.801
Dionne Warwick
was at the U.S. Open,

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:28.267
and the announcer called her
Gladys Knight,

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.033
and I was like, "What?!

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.801
Boy, can you see?"

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:34.300
I assume whoever did that
was immediately fired

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.968
and then rehired by the WNBA,

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.801
because at
the New York Liberty game,

00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:42.334
they showed Sam Jay on the
Jumbotron and said it was Ziwe.

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.167
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:47.701
No two people on planet Earth
look more different

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.634
than Sam Jay and Ziwe.

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:51.434
I hope you're not one of those
people who's like,

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:54.033
"I don't see color,"
because this is proof

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:56.133
color is the only thing you see.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:58.534
You literally found
another cute Black woman

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.901
and was like, "This'll do."
Well guess what.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.667
We're all cute,
you frigging idiot.

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:03.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.701
Next thing you know,
that Jumbotron guy

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:07.534
is gonna get hired by the Cubs
and be like,

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:09.467
"Harriet Tubman is here!"

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:14.934
Then, Dolly Parton released
a fun line of products for pets,

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.868
and I was like, "What?
That's great!"

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.601
But then I found out it included

00:02:18.601 --> 00:02:21.801
wigs for dogs, and I was like,
"What?! That's dumb."

00:02:21.801 --> 00:02:23.467
But then I saw it.

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:25.334
And I was like, "Wh-a-a-a-at?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:27.000
"You doggies look good!"

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.367
Is your name Jolene?
'Cause I'm begging you,

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:32.000
please don't take my man,
cute-ass dog.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.434
So then everyone was talking
about "quiet quitting,"

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:36.501
and I was like,
"What...is that?"

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:38.133
Then I found out
"quiet quitting" is doing

00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:40.567
the bare minimum at your job
while looking for a new one.

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:42.634
And I was like, "What?!
You cowards.

00:02:42.634 --> 00:02:44.667
Don't quit quietly, quit loud."

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.167
I'll show you how I quit.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:48.367
"Seth, I quit!"

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:49.901
-No, you don't.

00:02:49.901 --> 00:02:52.400
-Yeah, I don't, but only because
I love you so bad.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.234
-Aww!
-Shut up!

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:55.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:58.834
So then I read that a man
had his Tesla car keys

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:00.734
implanted in his hand.

00:03:00.734 --> 00:03:01.934
Look at this.

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.367
[ Horn chirps ]

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:07.300
♪♪

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:10.968
And I was like, "What...
a lazy bastard!"

00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:12.901
You sloppy bum.

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.868
You can't keep your car keys
in your dang pocket?

00:03:15.868 --> 00:03:18.834
Now, I'm scared to ask this,
but where is your wallet?"

00:03:18.834 --> 00:03:20.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.167
Y'all, if this guy offers you
a piece of gum, say no.

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.534
You do not know where it's been.

00:03:24.534 --> 00:03:25.868
What are you trying to do?

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:28.601
Turn yourself into
a real-life Inspector Gadget?

00:03:28.601 --> 00:03:30.634
Impossible!

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:33.501
But heck,
we all want impossible things.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:35.767
♪♪

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:38.000
♪ Maybe trump
will go to jail -- ♪

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.334
-Amber, I just think --

00:03:39.334 --> 00:03:40.334
Just don't
get ahead of ourselves.

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:42.167
This is not realistic.

00:03:42.167 --> 00:03:43.567
-Yeah, you right.

00:03:43.567 --> 00:03:47.434
So, then I was watching the U.S.
Women's gymnastics championships

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:50.100
and Konnor McClain won the gold,
and I was like, "What?

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.167
Yay! A Black lady won!
Yippee!"

00:03:52.167 --> 00:03:55.000
Then Shilese Jones
got the silver, and I was like,

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.067
"What, what?!

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:58.067
Two Black women?
Oh, my God, my heart."

00:03:58.067 --> 00:04:01.200
Then Jordan Chiles got bronze,
and I was like,

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.934
"What, what, what?!
This is a historic moment."

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:06.567
The entire winner's podium
was Black women.

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:07.968
These Black queens
made me feel like

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:09.534
I was a professional gymnast.

00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:12.300
But then I threw my back out
trying to pick up a Cheeto,

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.367
so I realized
that is not my ministry.

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:15.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.367 --> 00:04:18.267
But for a moment I was hopeful.

00:04:18.267 --> 00:04:20.934
And it's that hope
that's important.

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:22.033
You know what I hope?

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:23.534
♪♪

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:24.934
♪ Maybe he'll go to -- ♪

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:26.300
Ah, [bleep] it.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.100
There's no way a rich person
is gonna face consequences

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.234
for their actions.

00:04:30.234 --> 00:04:31.934
Ha ha ha!
Ridiculous.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.400
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
Dang it!

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.801
That's Wanda Sykes!
Who hired that guy?!

